 "remarks": "Set within Darien's coveted private Tokeneke Association, 5 Cross Road is a quintessential stone Colonial gracefully positioned on a private .70 acre property. Timeless architectural character, exceptional privacy, and inviting living spaces define this distinctive residence in one of the town's most sought-after coastal neighborhoods.The thoughtfully updated kitchen serves as the heart of the home, while an extraordinary family room with soaring ceilings and abundant natural light offers a dramatic yet welcoming setting for everyday living and entertaining. A desirable first-floor primary suite provides comfort and convenience, creating an ideal layout for modern living. Classic details and generous rooms throughout complement the home's enduring stone facade and beautifully secluded grounds. Enjoy the rare combination of a tranquil residential setting, private association lifestyle, and convenient access to Darien's village, schools, train, beaches, and waterfront. A special Tokeneke offering where classic New England charm meets effortless, refined living.",
